WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Work is piling up.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Choose a template and open Little Factory.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Search the model library and place a shelf.
Layout stays separate from calculations.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Add a packing station, then run and compare.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Same output: 40 → 40 completed.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Increase team capacity too, then run again.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Completed work: 40 → 77.
Synthetic example; same 80 arrivals.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Mean wait: 14.5 → 1.4 min.
One modeled hour, seed 4207.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Resource cost: $74 → $96.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Save this setup as a template. Reuse it.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Loopset. Build on it with me.
github.com/berkebasbay/loopset
